283: ## Key Data Flow
284: 
285: ### Price Refresh Cycle
286: 
287: ```
288: User clicks "Refresh Prices" or holding created
289:   → PriceService.getCurrentPrice(symbol, EQUITY)
290:     → Redis cache hit? return
291:     → market_prices DB hit? return
292:     → UpstoxPriceFetcher.fetchPriceData(symbol)
293:       → SymbolRepository resolves ISIN
294:       → GET /v3/market-quote/ltp?instrument_key=NSE_EQ|{ISIN}
295:       → returns { last_price, cp (prev close) }
296:     → fallback: YahooFinance → AlphaVantage
297:   → Redis cache (15 min TTL for EQUITY)
298:   → market_prices DB (daily row, source=UPSTOX)
299:   → Update holding currentPrice, dayChange, dayChangePct
300: ```
301: 
302: ### Net Worth Snapshot
303: 
304: ```
305: GET /api/v1/net-worth (or first investment-over-time call)
306:   → NetWorthService.calculateNetWorth(userId)
307:     → Sum all assets by type (equityValue, debtValue, goldValue)
308:     → Sum all liabilities
309:     → Net worth = assets - liabilities
310:   → NetWorthHistoryService.snapshotNetWorth(userId)
311:     → Store daily entry in Redis hash: networth:history:{userId}:{date}
312:     → TTL: 365 days
313:   → Investment growth chart reads this for "Value" line
314: ```
315: 
316: ### Gmail Bank Monitoring
317: 
318: ```
319: Scheduled every 5 min (or manual trigger)
320:   → GmailSyncService scans 18+ Indian bank email patterns
321:   → Fetches recent messages via Gmail API
322:   → EmailParserService extracts amount/balance/account-last4/date
