528: ### 8.3 Tax Harvesting Logic
529: 
530: ```
531: For each holding with unrealized gains:
532:   1. Check if holding period approaches 12 months (equity LTCG threshold)
533:   2. Calculate gain if sold today
534:   3. Check if total LTCG for FY < Rs. 1,25,000 (exemption limit)
535:   4. If gain fits within exemption:
536:      → Suggest: Sell to book gain tax-free, immediately rebuy
537:   5. If gain exceeds exemption:
538:      → Suggest: Sell only enough to utilize remaining exemption
539: ```
